"
attribute: "Center Frequency"
	"Basic Operation:Center Frequency"
	fD readwrite 1 119025
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_CENTER_FREQUENCY
"Sets the center frequency.

Property Value: 1151013

"
attribute: "Input Impedance"
	"Basic Operation:Input Impedance"
	fD readwrite 1 1312D9
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_INPUT_IMPEDANCE
"Sets the value of input impedance, in ohms, expected at the active input port. This is typically 50 ohms or 75 ohms.

Property Value: 1250009

AGN934XNI_VAL_INPUT_IMPEDANCE_50_OHM (5.00000000000000E+01)


AGN934XNI_VAL_INPUT_IMPEDANCE_75_OHM (7.50000000000000E+01)


"
attribute: "Frequency Offset"
	"Basic Operation:Frequency Offset"
	fD readwrite 1 1312D8
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_FREQUENCY_OFFSET
"Sets an offset value, in Hertz, that is added to the frequency readout. The offset is used to compensate for external frequency conversion. This changes the driver's Frequency Start and Frequency Stop properties.
The equations relating the affected values are:
Frequency Start = Actual Start Frequency + Frequency Offset
Frequency Stop = Actual Stop Frequency + Frequency Offset
Marker Position = Actual Marker Frequency + Frequency Offset

Property Value: 1250008

"
attribute: "Frequency Stop"
	"Basic Operation:Frequency Stop"
	fD readwrite 1 1312D7
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_FREQUENCY_STOP
"Sets the right edge of the frequency domain in Hertz. This is used in conjunction with the Frequency Start property to define the frequency domain. If the Frequency Start property value is equal to the Frequency Stop property value then the spectrum analyzer's horizontal properties are in time-domain.

Property Value: 1250007

"
attribute: "Frequency Start"
	"Basic Operation:Frequency Start"
	fD readwrite 1 1312D6
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_FREQUENCY_START
"Sets the left edge of the frequency domain in Hertz. This is used in conjunction with the Frequency Stop property to define the frequency domain. If the Frequency Start property value is equal to the Frequency Stop property value then the spectrum analyzer's horizontal properties are in time-domain.

Property Value: 1250006

"
