attribute: "Average Type"
	"Basic Operation:Average Type"
	iL enum { AGN934XNI_VAL_AVERAGE_TYPE_LOGPOWER=1, AGN934XNI_VAL_AVERAGE_TYPE_POWER=2, AGN934XNI_VAL_AVERAGE_TYPE_VOLTAGE=3 } readwrite 1 119020
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_AVERAGE_TYPE
"Selects the averaging type for the measurement:
LOG POWER - Averages the data as appropriate for the
logarithmic scaled y- axis.
Power - Converts the scale from logarithmic to linear power
units, and then averages the power trace data.
Voltage - Averages the data as appropriate for the linearly
scaled y- axis scale.

