attribute: "Gate Source"
	"Basic Operation:Gate Source"
	iL enum { AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_EXTERNAL=1, AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_PERIODIC_TIMER=2, AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_RF_BURST=3 } readwrite 1 11D281
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_GATE_SOURCE
"Selects the gate trigger source of gate sweep.

Command:
[:SENSe]:SWEep:EGATe:SOURce EXTernal|FRAMe|RFBurst

Property Value: 1168001

AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_EXTERNAL (1)
Set the gate trigger source of gate sweep to be External.

AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_PERIODIC_TIMER (2)
Set the gate trigger source of gate sweep to be Periodic Timer.

AGN934XNI_VAL_GATE_SOURCE_RF_BURST (3)
