	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_TRACE_MATH_TYPE
"Selects the trace math type of reflection measurement.
RM7 option support three trace type, measurement trace data plus memory saved trace data, immurement trace data minus memory saved trace data, and memory saved data minus measurement trace data.

Command:
