AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_TRACE_MATH_TYPE_ADD (2)
Toggles the trace math type of reflection measurement to be add.

AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_TRACE_MATH_TYPE_SUB (3)
Toggles the trace math type of reflection measurement to be subtract.

