attribute: "Reflection Measurement Display Mode"
	"Reflection Measurement:Reflection Measurement Display Mode"
	iL enum { AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_RL=1, AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_VSWR=2, AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_LIN=3 } readwrite 1 11C6E1
	//const: AGN934XNI_ATTR_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE
"Selects the reflection measurement display mode between Return Loss, VSWR and Reflection Coefficient. It's only available for Reflection Measurement mode, and Distance to Fault measurement mode.

Valid Values:
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_RL (1)  - Return Loss mode
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_VSWR (2)  - VSWR mode
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_LIN (3)  - Reflection Coefficient mode

Default Value:
AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_RL

SCPI Commands:
[:SENSe]:CAT:DISPlay:TYPE RL|VSWR|LIN

Property Value: 1165025

AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_RL (1)
Toggles the reflection measurement display mode to Return Loss mode.

AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_VSWR (2)
Toggles the reflection measurement display mode to VSWR mode.

AGN934XNI_VAL_REFLECTION_MEASUREMENT_DISPLAY_TYPE_LIN (3)
Toggles the reflection measurement display mode to Reflection Coefficient mode.

"
